  "description": "<p>Our company name is Meetall, meaning all-metal products and meet all goals. We are a small family-owned business working out of our machine shop in Connecticut. Our products are designed and made entirely by us, from scratch. The Meetall team consists of my Dad and my brother and I, Hunter. We currently offer two products, a custom design floating shelf and a fidget keychain. Production wise, we are capable of ramping up production to our current goal of 500 sales a week. We are trying to anodize our products in-house, but if there is quick demand we would outsource the anodizing. We are looking for a long-term partnership as our production side is solid and can always be made quicker. We have been in the machining business for awhile, but we need help with gaining some exposure and selling the products we make. We will gladly take advice from our affiliates due to our low experience in ecommerce.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We will work with affiliates and send out products to film content and give us critiques on what to do better.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Affiliates receive 10% of total referral sales</p>\r\n<p>After your first 50 sales, affiliates may apply for more and renegotiate, we want to cultivate a working partnership over time</p>\r\n<p>My email: hunter@hancockmfg.com&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
